        {
          "exampleId": "w:fresh#e-f67966927f90313e",
          "text": "Microplastics have become a common source of pollution across the Earth – they have settled in the deep sea and on the Himalayas, stuck inside volcanic rocks, filled the stomachs of seabirds and even fallen in fresh Antarctic snow.",
