        },
        {
          "exampleId": "w:fresh#e-6aa0fe8a7ec8da6c",
          "text": "Our devices, including computers, smartphones and the never-ending flow of online content, keep feeding us fresh updates, training us to expect continued stimulation.",
          "source": {
